1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,046
What actually changes when light enters glass?

2
00:00:03,046 --> 00:00:04,140
Look at the wave.

3
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:12,252
The vibrations inside the glass are driven by the vibrations arriving from the air, so they must keep exactly the same rhythm.

4
00:00:12,252 --> 00:00:16,497
Watch the two marked points: they bob up and down at the same rate.

